        "description": "GeekMag is a modern, fast magazine theme with a section-based homepage of article cards, built with clean semantic HTML5, lightweight CSS (no frameworks) and vanilla JavaScript. Includes a top utility bar with social links, breadcrumbs, native share buttons, an author box, related posts, a newsletter band, banner widget areas and thumbnail post widgets — all controlled from the Customizer. Translation ready."
